Additional note. This note does not change the MIT terms above.

The Wii sources written in this repository are MIT. `make` links
`third_party/OpenCE/port/linux/game/cache_file_formats.c` from Open
Community Edition (https://github.com/OpenCommunityEdition/OpenCE). That
file is AGPL-3.0-or-later. The resulting `boot.dol` / `boot.elf` is a
combined work under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or
any later version, including the AGPL's source-offer rules for network use.

OpenCE's own README describes the split: current OpenCE is AGPL-3.0-or-later,
while snapshots from before that project's AGPL transition stay CC0 1.0.
The pinned submodule commit is the one recorded by the gitlink; read its
LICENSE before assuming CC0. The MIT sources, taken by themselves and not
linked with the AGPL file, stay MIT.

`third_party/lz4` is Yann Collet's LZ4 library, BSD 2-Clause. See
`third_party/lz4/LICENSE`.

Neither license grants any right to Halo, its maps, or any other work owned
by Microsoft. No game data is included here.
